  ✓ Audit input/provenance integrity and copy source artifacts to scratch
  ✓ Verify program fidelity with translator identity and differential tests
  ✓ Fresh-build semantics and reconstruct all proof claims
  ✓ Review adequacy, real-program pinning, and satisfying witnesses
  ✓ Inventory and statically audit every K rule/declaration
  ✓ Create and run a fresh false non-vacuity mutation
  ✓ Account for proven versus assumed boundaries and write REVIEW.md
